<div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>这段代码先把栈指针对齐到8字节，然后在栈里留出一个stack_frame大小的空间，将R0、LR、PC、xPSR这几个关键寄存器设置成正确的值，其余寄存器设置为0xdeadbeef用于调试观察。</p>
<p>在PendSV异常处理程序中，完成任务的上下文切换：</p>
<div class="language-asm line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="asm" style="--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code" v-pre=""><code class="language-asm"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665">PendSV_Handler</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">    // 忽略其他代码</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD">    /* 保存当前任务的上下文 */</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">    MRS     R1, PSP</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">    STMFD   R1!, {R4 - </span><span style="--shiki-light:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375">R11</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">    STR</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">     R1, [R0]</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665">switch_to_thread</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD">    /* 恢复下一个任务的上下文 */</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">    LDR     R1, =rt_interrupt_to_thread</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">    LDR     R1, [R1]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">    LDR     R1, [R1]            </span><span style="--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD">/* 从任务控制块里取出栈顶指针 */</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">    LDMFD   R1!, {R4 - </span><span style="--shiki-light:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375">R11</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">}     </span><span style="--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD">/* 先弹出R4到R11 */</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">    MSR     PSP, R1             </span><span style="--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD">/* 更新PSP为新任务的栈指针 */</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665">pendsv_exit</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">    ORR     LR, LR, #</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91">0x04</span><span style="--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD">       /* 返回线程模式，使用PSP */</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375">    BX</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">      LR                  </span><span style="--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD">/* 中断返回，硬件自动弹出剩余寄存器 */</span></span></code></pre>
<div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>其中，switch_to_thread这部分实现任务上下文的恢复。对于初始运行的任务而言，栈的上下文虽是伪造的，但是看起来就像是“任务在运行入口时被打断一样”，当恢复上下文时，CPU自然就从任务的入口函数处开始运行。</p>
<p><strong>由此可见，整个过程对调度器来说是完全透明的，它不需要知道这是新任务的第一次运行还是旧任务的恢复。</strong></p>
<h2 id="总结" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#总结"><span>总结</span></a></h2>
<p>综上所述，RTOS创建任务时会在任务栈里预先填充一份伪造的上下文，以便让新创建的任务也能通过统一的任务切换流程开始运行，调度器不需要区分新任务和旧任务。</p>
<p>其中，最关键的是设置成任务函数的入口地址、以及入口参数的值。具体如何设置，与CPU架构特性、RTOS上下文恢复的方式、编译器有关。</p>
